  "id": "BIT-tomcat-2026-88041",
  "summary": "Apache Tomcat: HTTP/2 trailer header cross-contamination",
  "details": "Incomplete cleanup vulnerability in Apache Tomcat allowed an trailer information from a previous request to leak into a subsequent request.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat: from 11.0.0 through 11.0.26, from 10.1.27 through 10.1.60, from 9.0.92 through 9.0.122.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 11.0.27, 10.1.61 or 9.0.123, which fix the issue.",
